	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Comitia nostra, deo gloria, coronidem acceperunt, necdum aliud <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>agitur, quam quod hactenus actum est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nostri protestantur se non <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>unguem latum a confessione <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName> decessuros, catholici <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>hoc idem agunt se non pili facere nostram protestationem; apud <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>eos enim pluris esse ecclesiam quam nostrum pseudoevangelium.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Cęsar utranque partem fovet, et quia utriusque auxiliis eget, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>utranque partem suo sensu abundare permittit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Numerantur pro muniendis locis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l2510">Turcę</placeName> finitimis in triennis 500000 aurei, ducitur Caesari debitaeque aliqui <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>status nondum solverunt, ea faciunt 300000 aureorum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Pax inter <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Christum et Belial, ne alter alterius membra lędat, sancita <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et multa severitate stabilita sub magnis poenis transgressoribus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>infligenda.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hic habes comitiorum prologum, fabulam et <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>catastrophen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Mitto ad te <persName>Staphili</persName> libellum amarulentissimum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Philippum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vires deficiunt et confutationi <persName>Staphylorum</persName> nugis non s<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ufficiunt; triumphat ille superintendens <placeName ref="l619">Bavaricus</placeName>, etiam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>missus in <placeName ref="l449">Silesiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quid inter aurigandum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ita loquar, in <placeName ref="l449">Silesiam</placeName> ei contigit, imposita scheda <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>declarat.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Valde, valde timeo, ne nostra securitate et socordia <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et adversariorum austutia et diligentia perdamur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nostri <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hic concionatores intra męnia in utranque sopiti aurem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>in celebrandis quottidianis conviviis et muliercularum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>stultis in eos pręconiis et acclamationibus occupantur intra <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>parietes privatos altum dormitantes somnum se belle <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>functos suis officiis putant, si in hebdomada semel concionentur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, et saluta <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName> atque ceteros amicos<note type="misc">od. omnes</note> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> cursim 25. augusti anno etc. 59.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2856">G[ereon]</persName> t[uus].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[von <persName ref="p8430">Raphael Sailer</persName> geschrieben:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, divini verbi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>pastori fidelissimo, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>amico incomparabili.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
